# Project Structure and Architecture

## Application Structure
- **Next.js App Router**: Main application in [app/](mdc:app) directory
- **Pages**: 
  - Root: [app/page.tsx](mdc:app/page.tsx)
  - Corporate: [app/corporate/page.tsx](mdc:app/corporate/page.tsx)
  - Participant: [app/participant/page.tsx](mdc:app/participant/page.tsx)

## Component Organization
- **UI Components**: shadcn/ui base primitives in [components/ui/](mdc:components/ui)
- **Form Fields**: Atomic form components in [components/form/fields/](mdc:components/form/fields)
- **Form Composite**: Complex form sections in [components/form/composite/](mdc:components/form/composite) 
- **ConfigurableForm**: Main form architecture in [components/form/ConfigurableForm.tsx](mdc:components/form/ConfigurableForm.tsx)
- **Legacy Components**: Deprecated monolithic components in [components/](mdc:components)

## Library Structure
- **Utilities**: Helper functions in [lib/utils.ts](mdc:lib/utils.ts)
- **Stellar Integration**: Blockchain utilities in [lib/stellar/](mdc:lib/stellar)
- **Form Configurations**: Declarative form configs in [lib/config/forms/](mdc:lib/config/forms)
- **Validation Schemas**: Modular Zod schemas in [lib/validation/schemas/](mdc:lib/validation/schemas)
- **Legacy Validation**: [lib/validation.ts](mdc:lib/validation.ts) (deprecated)
- **File Upload**: Upload utilities in [lib/upload.ts](mdc:lib/upload.ts)

## Layout Pattern
- **Root Layout**: [app/layout.tsx](mdc:app/layout.tsx) - global layout and providers
- **Page Layouts**: Specific layouts for corporate and participant sections
- **Theme Provider**: [components/ThemeProvider.tsx](mdc:components/ThemeProvider.tsx) for theme management

## Route Organization
- **Corporate Flow**: `/corporate` - for corporate user registration
- **Participant Flow**: `/participant` - for participant registration
- **API Routes**: `/api/*` - server-side endpoints

## Configuration Files
- **Next.js**: [next.config.js](mdc:next.config.js)
- **TypeScript**: [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json)
- **Tailwind**: [tailwind.config.ts](mdc:tailwind.config.ts)
- **Components**: [components.json](mdc:components.json)

## Development Workflow
- Follow user-specific rules: Russian for communication, English for code
- Implement KISS, DRY, and YAGNI principles
- Never modify server state during development
- Test all changes thoroughly before deployment